        "original_id": "51d30afb-f095-55a5-845c-fc2252174aef",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Darby O'Gill and the Little People, Dangal, Walt Disney's Treasury of Classic Tales\n- Companies: Walt Disney Productions, Walt Disney Pictures, Aamir Khan Productions, UTV Motion Pictures\n- People: Albert Sharpe, Janet Munro, Sean Connery, Jimmy O'Dea, Aamir Khan\n- Topics: Disney film adaptations\n\nFacts:\n- Darby O'Gill and the Little People is a 1959 Walt Disney Productions feature film.\n- Darby O'Gill and the Little People stars Albert Sharpe, Janet Munro, Sean Connery, and Jimmy O'Dea.\n- Darby O'Gill and the Little People tells a story about a wily Irishman and his battle of wits with leprechauns.\n- Dangal was produced by Walt Disney Pictures, Aamir Khan Productions, and UTV Motion Pictures.\n- Dangal stars Aamir Khan as the father.\n- Walt Disney's Treasury of Classic Tales adapted different Disney films, including Darby O'Gill and the Little People, Peter Pan, and Davy Crockett.",
